{"id": null, "n": "0125001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0125001", "type": "mod", "text": "以何【大】，何以【聖】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0125002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0125002", "type": "mod", "text": "不得言【大】，得言不【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0125003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0125003", "type": "mod", "text": "句如是言【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【宮】【聖】，明註曰南藏少句如是言四字"}
